<<~ ahu slot=`#/boundary-calls`>>

!! Boundary calls

Keep `CensusRefusal` for unlisted sealed files during rotation: it detects a present custody hazard, not a previous house name (`packages/lararium-mesh/src/sealed-writer.ts:132-139,377-387`). Keep the browser continuity refusal if it prevents silent identity re-founding after local storage loss (`packages/lararium-browser/src/browser-vessel-identity.ts:46-48,270-279`). Keep transcript grammar tolerance when the source comes from outside the house's re-renderable carrier store (`bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/wild-bytes.mem:62-67,133-142`). Keep API-required tool versions, CI dependency versions, and cryptographic domains unless a separate ruling proves them internal dead artifacts (`tools/evergreen-boundary.mjs:33-37`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml:82-84`; `tools/domain-registry-witness.sh:11-28`).

<<~/ahu>>

