<<~ ahu slot=`#/witness-pattern-to-keep-crud-from-regrowing`>>

!! Witness pattern to keep crud from regrowing

Extend the standing narration witness beyond `packages/*/src` and `tools/` to live API and lararium canon, excluding `history/`, `research/`, `hoike/`, testimony, and CHANGELOG carriers (`tools/evergreen-boundary.mjs:143-151`; `bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/working-procedures.mem:173-174`). Make each exception name a present external protocol or trust boundary, with a stale-exception failure like `tools/evergreen-boundary.mjs:114-125`. For persistence, witness the narrower present invariant: no delete-on-upgrade for retired house stores, no old-name lookup, and no specialized OldShapeRefusal family (`packages/lararium-browser/src/browser-vessel-identity.ts:94-119`; `packages/lararium-mesh/src/sealed-writer.ts:150-188`). Burn any one-commit retired-name census after its moving commit, as the ruling requires (`bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/working-procedures.mem:173-174`).

